EG-TARGET-SUPPORT-DESIGN-CONTRACT-20261027,20261027,Early gate architecture; repaired source-evidence 468-update development observation; not a training initialization,experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/target_support_design_20261027/source_manifest.json; experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/target_support_design_20261027/after_manifest.json,Independent default-off prototypes; max_attenuation=0.25; no host config or forward change,42,"Synthetic cosine counterexamples; read-only historical 96-sequence CSV (54666 frames, <=2000 frames per sequence)",21 CPU algebraic/tensor/gradient checks; descriptive reanalysis only; no model training or tracking evaluation,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA (CPU only),Python3.8.20; PyTorch2.0.0+cu118; CPU threads1; OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 MKL_NUM_THREADS=1; no CUDA execution,0,NA (no checkpoint loaded),"Max and permutation-invariant distribution summaries cannot distinguish equal similarity multisets at target vs background positions. Explicit target-support contrast can, conditional on a correct target reference; cross-only bounded attenuation is a separate unvalidated task-utility hypothesis.","21/21 prototype contracts passed. Constructed margins +0.8/-0.2667 distinguish location; deliberately wrong support reverses the decision. Default off/zero strength identity, source axis, Value gradients, detached new evidence, serialization, RNG noninterference checked. Parameter increment 0. Normal-group loss is tail-concentrated: worst3 -59.8528/-36.3362/-26.2673 pp; remaining29 +0.1580 pp is descriptive only. No task improvement, deployed support correctness or historical failure cause established. Detailed dataflow added: early evidence -> target-support reference -> source contrast -> bounded cross-only action -> attention aggregate -> localization/free trajectory. Clarifies action and optimization coupling, axis contracts and stagewise counterfactuals. Added end-to-end image-to-tracker information flow and exact joint-template MHSA equations: QKV, scaled dot-product attention, four modality blocks, Early gate source mapping, candidate h insertion, center head, losses and free-run feedback.",DESIGN-COMPLETE / ALGEBRAIC-CONTRACT-PASS / NOT-INTEGRATED / NO-TRAINING,experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/target_support_design_20261027/DESIGN.md; experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/target_support_design_20261027/contract_results.json; experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/target_support_design_20261027/contract_stdout.log; experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/target_support_design_20261027/after_manifest.json; end-to-end flow and formula derivation in DESIGN.md sections 11-12; experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/target_support_design_20261027/after_manifest.json,"No old audit tool called. No tracker, train entry, protected asset or optimizer changed. Reference estimator is specified but not implemented/validated. Synthetic contracts do not replace real-data integration checks. First export failure separately registered. Prior over-attributions corrected without removing old evidence. | Expanded DESIGN.md sections 10.1-10.7 give tensor-level paths, exact two-direction message equations, g*h coupling, shared-gradient limits, module-to-subproblem mapping and per-edge falsification reads. No model integration/training. | Sections 11-12 now explain input crops/token counts, early context timing, TBSI template update, search fusion/CENTER output, training versus tracker feedback, standard MHSA equations and source-indexed gate broadcast."
