EG-GATE-TRANSPORT-TWO-HYPOTHESIS-SCOPE-20261027,20261027,Original MSHA + Early gate architecture; original Early gate retained as comparator; no tracker initialization,HEAD 6d95ad0d09eea92e0f397fcc8256611e0e03998f; gate_transport_scope_20261027/before_manifest.json; before/; record.json,"NA - scope/design only, no run configuration",NA,NA - read-only historical development results; no new dataset sampling/evaluation,Independent judgement on gate guidance and two-mechanism scope; no new performance/causal measurement,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,Python 3.8.20 CPU standard-library documentation review; no model/GPU execution,0,NA - no checkpoint loaded or modified,"HG: target-vs-background referenced evidence addresses the position information lost by max-based Early gate evidence. HT: query-specific cross relation redistribution offers benefit beyond source amplitude, with original cross row mass retained. Neither is an established M1 root cause.","支持下一步单变量检验（方案层面）。Narrow to G*+T relative to original MSHA, remove C; original Early gate remains comparator. T matching confidence is not task-utility supervision; remove extra rejection/gating from T. Candidate normal-group regressions are not direct proof of original Early gate harm. Target support and T solver/identity contracts remain unimplemented/unresolved.",SCOPE-DECISION / DESIGN-DRAFT / NOT-IMPLEMENTED / NO-TRAINING,experiments/early_gate_closed_loop_20261026/gate_transport_scope_20261027/DIRECTION.md; before_manifest.json; record.json; original source snapshots in before/,"Supersedes C+T priority in previous orthogonal_msha draft due to explicit user time/module budget, not experimental refutation. No new loss/teacher/multistage training proposed in first version. Exploratory E/G*/G*+T comparisons do not replace paper B/G*/T/G*+T factorial; unmatched historical Early gate cannot substitute a fresh control."
